  "markup": "\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\u00220 0 []\u0022\u003EYou can now add a widget to your own website, and people can give you a HIGH 5, YOU ROCK! Shout out.\u0026nbsp;\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll you have to do is add this code snippet to your website, and then when someone visits your page, they can sign in with GitHub or Google and give you a virtual High 5. All High5s are then added to our homepage feed.\u0026nbsp;\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u0026lt;script src=\u0022https://h5yr.com/widget/embed.js\u0022 \n        data-bgcolor=\u0022fff\u0022 \n        data-color=\u0022000\u0022 \n        data-accent=\u00226E48AA\u0022\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/script\u0026gt;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou can change the background colour, the font colour and the accent colour, just update the data attributes of the script.\u0026nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EOnce you add this to your site, you will see a widget like the one below.\u003Cbr\u003EThe first image shows the sign-in screen. The second screen shows a button to give a H5YR, and the third screen is the message you get once a High Five has been given.\u0026nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cimg data-udi=\u0022umb://media/2c2712bf39274c4dbef16dfb355ac6bd\u0022 src=\u0022?rmode=max\u0026amp;width=340\u0026amp;height=327\u0026amp;hmac=2e52d43b30f1e01123391a5ce48901e96de705e380c81cd4e44a945df2d8ccfb\u0022 width=\u0022340\u0022 height=\u0022327\u0022\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Cimg data-udi=\u0022umb://media/866aa48b39364662bbdee7a569dea189\u0022 src=\u0022?rmode=max\u0026amp;width=309\u0026amp;height=325\u0026amp;hmac=35b2f832fc3fe07b414dad741229fd640c1b67d3af50dd2f267357bea7a53f53\u0022 width=\u0022309\u0022 height=\u0022325\u0022\u003E\u003Cimg data-udi=\u0022umb://media/b646123302de4f4f96b69020cc7bf3ed\u0022 src=\u0022?rmode=max\u0026amp;width=304\u0026amp;height=361\u0026amp;hmac=6a75f3845abead90df133be2b96a119ba8014ba70ee9f38ef57112590b4d10d9\u0022 width=\u0022304\u0022 height=\u0022361\u0022\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThanks, Matt Brailsford, for suggesting this idea on our \u003Ca data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022https://github.com/H5YR/High5YouRock\u0022 title=\u0022github.com\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003EGitHub\u003C/a\u003E. If you have any ideas on future features, or if you would like to help build some new features, all contributions are very welcome.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </bodyText>
